thinking-correction-binding:
    > Spec's MAX_THINKING_TOKENS=0-off + percent-table is STALE for 5-series (measured §14, binary 2.1.268): budget resolves then is DISCARDED on the adaptive branch; clamp [1024, rF-1] arithmetically right but unreachable; 5%=6400 legal yet inert.
    > CORRECTED chooser: --effort low/med/high/xhigh/max is the live dial (opus-5 cost low .67 med .76 high 1 xhigh 1.6 max 1.7, default high; fable-5 low .6 … max 1.91 + per_turn_effort); hard zero = --thinking disabled (opus-5 measured 0; fable rejects_disabled_thinking); MAX_THINKING_TOKENS left UNSET (else reads-configured-while-inert AND errors with effort); --max-thinking-tokens silently dead (print-only); flag/env twins unproven-equal (--effort low 994 vs CLAUDE_EFFORT=low 3002 one sample each).
    > Preview note corrected: "thinking off via effort low + unset budget; hard zero via --thinking disabled (opus-5; fable rejects)" — replaces spec's effort-gated-0 table.

depth-type-corrected-map:
    signal-md-nt:
        > Depth: md >-count (blockquote) = nt >-count IN CONTENT after string tag (pretty-printed)
        > Label: md [!IMPORTANT] = nt text content or key name
        > String tag: md N/A = nt first '> '+space always stripped
        > Two roles: md one (blockquote) = nt two (first structural, rest visual depth)
    pretty-print: re.sub first-tag-strip; renderer lives in Program, AMPLIFIED by .dtd LAW (not replaced)
    no-whitespace-form: tab-indented '> > [!X]' nests without spaces (NestedText 3.8 technique)

variant-chain-dtd:
    order: RNG ENT MOD DCL XSD SCH XSL NVDL DITA DITAMAP XSPEC RELS SOC FRAMEWORK XHTML SVG CHAIN SKILL SCHEMATIC DEPTH DOCUMENT-TYPE-DEFINITION
    skill: DTD-CREATION-SUITE-ROT-DOMAIN.md/nt/yaml — DOMAIN-TYPE-DEFINITION routing, Graphic+Schematic polyglot (SVG-in-yaml/md screenshot hosting), 1-time ask + save-my-cache bridge, Research-family trigger, Save-ur-cache mid-WIP, drift time-out triggers (patches/directives/debug/family-activation), CHAIN-DTD multi-activation incl. Phantom/Thinking no-ask commands, skills OVERHAUL+rename allowed

